<!-- ═══ INTRO — 2-col with image ═══ -->
<section class="rsh-intro">
  <div class="rsh-intro__container">
    <div class="rsh-intro__content">
      <span class="rsh-eyebrow">Our Services</span>
      <h2 class="cmr-intro__title">Why Invest in window film for your business?</h2>
      <p class="rsh-intro__lead">Philadelphia business owners and property managers choose commercial window tinting in Philadelphia as a cost-effective building envelope upgrade that pays for itself through energy savings, tenant comfort, and reduced maintenance. Whether you manage a Center City office tower, a retail storefront on South Street, or a multi-building hotel property, we install film that reduces HVAC load, eliminates screen glare, adds security, and protects merchandise — all applied to your existing glass.</p>
      <p class="rsh-intro__lead">We assess every pane individually — glass type, age, condition, orientation, and thermal stress risk — before recommending a product. Different zones of the same building often need different films: solar control on the west facade, glare reduction on the south, security film on the ground floor. That's how we've worked since 2008. According to the <a href="https://www.osha.gov/computer-workstations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--rsh-green); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;">OSHA Computer Workstations eTool</a>, excessive glare is a recognized workplace ergonomic hazard that causes eye strain and headaches — window film eliminates it at the source.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rsh-intro__image-wrap">
      <img src="/images/commercial/commercial-window-tinting-philadelphia-interior.jpg" alt="Philadelphia commercial office interior with window tinting installed" title="Philadelphia commercial office with window tinting — Window Film Philadelphia" class="rsh-intro__image" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

